      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is affecting a popular public avatar (the fluffy gryphon edit) super badly. It vibrates horribly when you look down in 3pt tracking while standing. https://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_398aaafe-14f0-45a1-8b0e-fdf821d5dbb3\n\nAfter hours of troubleshooting yesterday, I figured out the avatar root was shaking. The link Laser Raptor sent is dead rn, but you can easily recreate it by throwing a cube on the root of any of your avatars. Make sure your locomotion is on, you have FBT off, and if you have a camera out, turn off flying.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
